<navigation-bar title="每日营养报告" back="{{false}}" color="#2d2623" background="transparent"><view slot="left" class="nav-circle" bindtap="goBack"><view class="back-icon"></view></view><view slot="right" class="share-button" bindtap="refreshReport"><text>更新</text></view></navigation-bar>
<scroll-view class="report-scroll" scroll-y enhanced show-scrollbar="{{false}}"><view class="page-shell report-page">
  <view class="report-meta"><image src="/assets/baby-avatar-v2.jpg" mode="aspectFill"></image><view><text class="meta-name">{{babyName}}</text><text>{{ageText}}</text></view><view class="date-pill"><text>{{dateLabel}}</text><view class="calendar-small"></view></view></view>
  <view class="overview-card ui-card"><view class="overview-score"><text>已确认数据覆盖率</text><view><text class="big-score">{{coverage}}</text><text>%</text></view><text class="praise-pill">{{reportStatus}}</text></view><image src="/assets/baby-eating-focus-v3.jpg" mode="aspectFill"></image><view class="radar-panel"><view class="radar-title">报告边界 <view class="info-icon">i</view></view><text>仅比较经审核的人群参考规则</text><text>不构成医学诊断或喂养处方</text><text>缺失值不会按零计算</text></view></view>
  <view class="intake-card ui-card"><view class="intake-heading"><text class="section-title">营养摄入参考</text><view class="legend"><view><view class="dot good"></view><text>达到参考</text></view><view><view class="dot warn"></view><text>需注意</text></view><view><view class="dot danger"></view><text>超过上限</text></view></view></view><view class="intake-grid"><view class="intake-item" wx:for="{{nutrients}}" wx:key="name"><text class="intake-name">{{item.name}}</text><view class="nutrient-symbol">{{item.badge}}</view><view class="intake-ring" style="background: conic-gradient({{item.color}} {{item.value}}%, #f2e9e4 0)"><view>{{item.value}}%</view></view><text>{{item.amount}}</text><text class="status-pill {{item.warn ? 'warn' : ''}}">{{item.status}}</text></view></view><view class="intake-tip"><view class="bulb"></view><text>百分比表示该营养素的数据覆盖率，不是达标率；具体状态以经审核规则比较为准。</text></view></view>
  <view class="insight-card ui-card"><view class="insight-title"><text>数据警告与说明</text><view class="smile-icon"><view></view></view></view><view class="highlight-row" wx:for="{{warnings}}" wx:key="*this"><view class="round-check"><view class="check-icon"></view></view><view><text>{{item}}</text></view></view><view wx:if="{{!warnings.length}}" class="highlight-row"><view class="round-check"><view class="check-icon"></view></view><view><text>当前报告没有额外数据警告</text></view></view></view>
  <view class="streak-card"><image src="/assets/baby-avatar-v2.jpg" mode="aspectFill"></image><view><text>坚持记录是形成可靠参考的第一步</text><text>食材和实际吃下的份量仍需照护者逐项确认</text></view><button bindtap="openRecords">查看记录</button></view>
</view></scroll-view>
<app-tabbar active="report" showCamera="{{true}}"></app-tabbar>
